# Preserve file bytes exactly.
#
# The vendor SDK tree intentionally mixes CRLF (C sources) and LF
# (BuildBIN.sh, precompile.sh, ...), and this machine has a system-level
# core.autocrlf=true in "D:/Program Files/Git/etc/gitconfig". Without this
# attribute git would rewrite the LF-only build scripts to CRLF on checkout
# and break them. -text disables all EOL conversion.
* -text